%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as Terminal
  participant P1 as CLI
  participant P2 as agent-plane
  participant P3 as Decisions
  participant P4 as PostgreSQL
  P0->>P1: register a
  Note over P1: choose request id R1
  P1->>P2: register R1, P
  P2->>P3: event: register R1
  P3->>P2: effect: reserve
  P2->>P4: transaction: reserve R1
  P4->>P2: committed
  P2->>P3: event: committed
  P3->>P2: reply: registered
  P2->>P1: record: registered
  P1->>P0: print record
  P0->>P1: inspect a
  P1->>P2: inspect a
  P2->>P4: read record
  P4->>P2: intent only, no machine
  P2->>P1: same record
  P1->>P0: print record
